action: read_file src/checkout.py

[response 3]
thought: checkout.py applies the coupon percent via subtotal_after_coupon and then again via discount_amount. I need to see discounts.py and pricing.py to confirm before editing.
action: read_file src/discounts.py

[response 4]
thought: checkout.py applies the coupon via subtotal_after_coupon and then again via discount_amount on the full subtotal. I need to see pricing.py to confirm how subtotal_after_coupon handles promo items before editing.
action: read_file src/pricing.py

[response 5]
thought: The bug is in checkout.py: it applies the coupon to discounted_subtotal via subtotal_after_coupon, then applies discount_amount on the full subtotal again, so the coupon is effectively applied twice. Also, discount_amount applies to promotional items, which violates the rule. The fix is to only use subtotal_after_coupon. I'll edit checkout.py accordingly.
action: edit_file src/checkout.py

